{"data":{"body":"[P3] Add default local replay coverage for this example. This is the only Java test referencing the new handler, and it is skipped unless both cloud flags are enabled, so normal `mvn test` never exercises its step/wait/replay path or verifies the restored output. Add a `LocalDurableTestRunner` test using a temporary filesystem configuration, asserting the final length/checksum and that the pre-wait step executes once; retain this test for EFS integration.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc7ppnJv","finding_digest":"eee8be2e7dc7e99e942110bc38a63cc855fe0716ec5fa86586df9d35d29e9bd4","finding_id":"arf_v1_53ul4lt5y7uz5fbbcc6drjr4zb","finding_key":"examples/cloudbasedintegrationtest::testfilesystempayloadoffloaderexample::local-replay-coverage-missing","identity_key":"examples/cloudbasedintegrationtest::testfilesystempayloadoffloaderexample::local-replay-coverage-missing","line":93,"observation_digest":"adc4e731c3482b9e6ebd6a3548402e1dfe3cc5de5bcba456494312fd6ec493e5","observation_id":"aro_v1_vxcoomodjavz43v5ni2uqqbodx","path":"examples/src/test/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/examples/CloudBasedIntegrationTest.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-09-03T00:43:39Z","review_id":"arr_v1_54rqfgiwjoacw33nnmu3xybj24","reviewed_base_sha":"9f353ea2a1d728885c69a203b7733e728ec7bc2e","reviewed_head_sha":"fbfc064364bdc1c59fb7a93ba3cef2a6b2ba5ecb","reviewer":"codex","start_line":92,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":683},"record_id":"art_v1_rqffdnqy3dd6uh5fwd5routlfo","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-09-03T00:43:39Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
